{
  "note_claim": "The event is Christian baptism symbolizing repentance and new life, not \"holy water\" cleansing sins by itself.",
  "label": "SUPPORTS",
  "quote": "there is no automatic connection between the rite of baptism and the experience of divine forgiveness. God makes a true promise to forgive sin in baptism, but that promise is made only to those who repent.",
  "reason": "The page explains that baptism requires repentance for forgiveness and is a sign, not an automatic cleansing by water."
}
